{"availability":"available","full":"tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer","name":"payment-integrity-reviewer","description":"A reviewer queue for payment-integrity claims on synthetic data. Three deterministic rules flag duplicate billing, unbundling and out-of-network adjudication; every flag shows the fields that fired it and a grounded explanation; a human approves, dismisses or escalates. Live demo runs cached, no API key.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-10T01:45:54Z","updated":"2026-10-06T23:43:20Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://payment-integrity-reviewer.onrender.com/","topics":["anthropic","claude","docker","fastapi","healthcare","htmx","llm","python","sqlite"],"demo":"https://payment-integrity-reviewer.onrender.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:15.608Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:15.608Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:59:15.608Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:22.963Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.915Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:24.844Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:59:15.608Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["© 2026 Trevor J. Romack — source-available for review, not open-source (LICENSE). No reuse or commercial use without permission. · tjromack@gmail.com","A claims-review workflow that detects likely payment-integrity issues on synthetic claims with transparent rules, explains each flag in plain English with an LLM, and routes them through a human approval queue — with a running tally of estimated dollars identified.","It brings together automation, decision support, a human-in-the-loop experience, cost-savings tracking, and responsible AI in a payment-integrity workflow. The defining design choice — keeping detection transparent and auditable while using AI only for explanation — is the \"where AI should and should not be used\" judgment applied to a regulated, high-stakes workflow."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"945567f21e2b9290bfd9f239c072e8fcf4bf45745017c200d5aeeb744a0fa51d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:36:39.082Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:13.059Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"© 2026 Trevor J. Romack — source-available for review, not open-source (LICENSE). No reuse or commercial use without permission. · tjromack@gmail.com","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"945567f21e2b9290bfd9f239c072e8fcf4bf45745017c200d5aeeb744a0fa51d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:13.059Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T23:43:20Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjromack/payment-integrity-reviewer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:13.060Z","hash":"945567f21e2b9290bfd9f239c072e8fcf4bf45745017c200d5aeeb744a0fa51d","originalBytes":12481,"storedBytes":12481,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:12.915Z","subjects":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple","Templates & UI components","Portfolios & personal sites","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"platforms":[],"qualityPriority":false,"demoHealth":{"url":"https://payment-integrity-reviewer.onrender.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T05:19:59.602Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"unknown","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":9,"error":{"reason":"http_503","at":"2026-10-19T05:19:59.602Z"},"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-22T05:19:59.602Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-